  "description": "One Bedroom Apartment, Five Minutes from Ashbourne\nAvailable to Let | €2,300 per month\nA bright and spacious one bedroom apartment in a private and peaceful setting just five minutes outside Ashbourne.\nRecently refurbished and finished to a very high standard, this property is presented in excellent condition throughout and will be available to let for the first time. The accommodation comprises a generous open plan kitchen, dining and living area, a spacious double bedroom with built in wardrobes and a modern bathroom.\nThe open plan living space is particularly bright and offers plenty of room for both living and dining. The apartment also benefits from electric heating and a private patio area.\nThe property is situated behind secure electric gates and benefits from private parking, offering a high level of privacy and security. The setting is extremely peaceful while still being very convenient, with Ashbourne just five minutes away and easy access to the M2 and Dublin.\nThis is a well presented, high quality apartment offering a rare combination of space, privacy and convenience, and would make an ideal home for someone looking for a property in excellent condition in a quiet setting close to Dublin.\nViewing is highly recommended.",
